message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "InfiniteZero DevNet"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "InfiniteZero Foundation"
    website: "https://github.com/InfiniteZeroFoundation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/InfiniteZeroFoundation/DevNet"
url: "https://github.com/InfiniteZeroFoundation"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-19
abstract: >-
  An open protocol for training shared AI models on data where it lives.
  Participants train models locally with federated learning and share model
  updates rather than raw data, while smart contracts on Ethereum coordinate,
  verify and reward each training round. This repository contains the InfiniteZero
  smart contracts, the dincli command-line tool, reference model services and
  documentation for the DevNet test network.
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - decentralized AI
  - privacy-preserving machine learning
  - differential privacy
  - Ethereum
  - smart contracts
  - public goods
